    "prototype_id": "A05",
    "title": "Spinach: no supply after Tue 22 Dec (orders 90 crates/week)",
    "body": "Κάτω Κάμπος gives ~83 crates/week until Sat 28 Nov (already 7-19 short/week). Week Mon 30 Nov-Sun 6 Dec only ~45 (gap between lots). Pachi gives ~79/week Thu 3-Tue 22 Dec. From Wed 23 Dec nothing is planted - and Christmas week orders are ~117.",
    "action": "Sow spinach now on Νότιος Κάμπος (R04) – earliest it can help is ~mid-Jan. For 23 Dec - mid-Jan: buy in or agree lower volumes with clients.",
    "why_rule": "Gap = weekly orders - weekly supply (est. crates spread evenly over each planting's harvest window).",
    "severity": "medium"
  },
  "notes": "Week 16–22 Nov gap 8.7 < 10 % of orders (9) → not an alert week under RULES thresholds (prototype said '7–19 short/week'). Supply uses remaining crates after logged cuts (151 for PL01), so W47/W48 are 81.3/69.7 instead of the prototype's 83/71. Christmas week orders 90 × 1.3 = 117."
